"optimizations-with-sabre/extracted-outputs/eead9bd2-17e0-4f5b-80bc-"
"eb9b30af052e-0.avif)\n"
msgstr ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/tutorials/transpilation-"
"optimizations-with-sabre/extracted-outputs/eead9bd2-17e0-4f5b-80bc-"
